                        "review": "Cool, another one you can play through in one crying session.\n\nBut for real, I didn't expect the story to unfold in such a sad and dark way, I thought it would maybe be half as sad and then it just derailed more and more. The beautiful and atmospheric pixel art is doing it's own to amplify it all. \n\nGame wise it's different in every chapter, it's mostly puzzles and a bit dexterity sometimes, but nothing too challenging. There's hidden items, otherwise it's all pretty straight forward, sometimes very slow paced, but I was so invested in the story that I played it in one sitting.",
